Package: gaSampling
Title: Genetic Algorithm for Two-Stage Stratified Cluster Allocation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Fhatuwani", "Mokwenda", , "fmokwen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Roxy", "Campher", role = "aut"),
    person()
  )
Description: Finds optimal allocations of clusters and units in two-stage
    stratified cluster sampling using a genetic algorithm. Provides
    helpers to prepare the sampling frame, build feasible starting
    allocations and check sample size and budget constraints.
